	Dangerous comparisons:
	- require(bool)(addressToGoldDeposit[msg.sender] >= _amount) (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1311)
CryptoSagaDungeonVer1.enterDungeon(uint256[4],uint32) (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1713-1996) uses timestamp for comparisons
	Dangerous comparisons:
	- require(bool)(addressToPlayRecordDateTime[msg.sender] + coolDungeon <= now) (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1735)
	- min(max(((_unitStats[_slotId][3] * 150 / 100) - _unitStats[_targetSlotId][2]),75),99) <= random(100,0) (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1884)
	- 75 <= random(100,0) (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1888)
	- min(max((_unitStats[_slotId][3] - _unitStats[_targetSlotId][3]),5),75) > random(100,0) (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1894)
	- 5 > random(100,0) (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1898)
CryptoSagaDungeonVer1.checkOwnershipAndAvailability(address,uint256[4]) (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1999-2024) uses timestamp for comparisons
	Dangerous comparisons:
	- _heroAvailAts[0] <= now && _heroAvailAts[1] <= now && _heroAvailAts[2] <= now && _heroAvailAts[3] <= now (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#2016)
