	- EventStructWrongData
	- NestedArrayFunctionCallDecoder.
It is used by:
	- ^0.4.18 (contracts/safe/safe_159_SAFE.sol#1)
solc-0.4.18 is an outdated solc version. Use a more recent version (at least 0.8.0), if possible.
